{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/conj-vorticity-lower-bound","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Conjecture","doco:Section"],"label":"conj:vorticity-lower-bound","kind":"conjecture","title":"Vorticity lower bound for anti-parallel filament collision as $q \\to 1$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/thm-q-bkm","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/conj-q-aubin-lions"],"tags":["vorticity","lower-bound","biot-savart","anti-parallel","blowup","last-gap"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.FluidDynamics.vorticity_lower_bound_conditional","text":"vorticity-lower-bound.md","leanSource":"vorticity-lower-bound.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"conj:vorticity-lower-bound\"></a><p><strong>Conditional on <a href=\"#conj:q-aubin-lions\" data-at=\"fluid-dynamics/ns-approaches\">q-Aubin--Lions</a>.</strong> Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">v^*</code> be the weak limit as <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q \\to 1</code> of the q-NS solution for anti-parallel vortex pair initial data. Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\omega^* = \\nabla \\times v^*</code> and let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">d(t)</code> be the separation between the two filament cores. There exist constants <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">c_1, c_2 > 0</code> such that for all <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">t &#x3C; T^*</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  c_1\\sqrt{T^* - t} \\leq d(t) \\leq c_2\\sqrt{T^* - t},\n  \\qquad\n  \\lVert \\omega^*(t) \\rVert_{L^\\infty} \\geq \\frac{c_1}{T^* - t},\n  \\qquad\n  \\int_0^{T^*} \\lVert \\omega^*(t) \\rVert_{L^\\infty}\\,dt = +\\infty.</code></pre>\n<p>These give, respectively, (a) separation decay, (b) a vorticity lower bound, and (c) BKM divergence. In particular, the limit solution <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">v^*</code> loses regularity at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T^*</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/vorticity-lower-bound.md","heading":"Conjecture","number":"20.7.15","page":"b/conj-vorticity-lower-bound","qa":{"counts":{"pass":90,"fail":1,"warn":0,"na":13,"unknown":0,"stale":79},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.FluidDynamics.vorticity_lower_bound_conditional","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/vorticity-lower-bound.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
